From 46a85fe612730066f566b451e87a5476537aadd9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ameya Deshpande <adeshpande610@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 21:17:37 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] imagination: Correct DDK 25.1 PMR allocation and
 unreference ABI and update verified BXM-8-256 features

- Fix PVR_SRV_BRIDGE_MM_PMRUNREFPMR_V25 from Func 1 (PMRUNEXPORTPMR) to Func 7 (PMRUNREFPMR).
- Implement DDK 25.1 branch in pvr_srv_alloc_pmr() using Func 8 (PHYSMEMNEWRAMBACKEDPMR) with 56-byte input and 20-byte output structures.
- Add compile-time _Static_assert guards for PHYSMEMNEWRAMBACKEDPMR structure sizes and field offsets.
- Add NULL PMR guard in pvr_srv_free_pmr() and clear pmr pointer after buffer release.
- Update BXM-8-256 device_info with hardware parameters extracted directly from pvrsrvkm.ko feature tables (num_clusters=1, fbcdc_algorithm=4, slc_cache_line_size=1024, tile_size=32x32).
---
 .../common/device_info/bxm-8-256.h            | 19 +++++----
 .../vulkan/winsys/pvrsrvkm/pvr_srv_bo.c       |  1 +
 .../vulkan/winsys/pvrsrvkm/pvr_srv_bridge.c   | 40 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../winsys/pvrsrvkm/pvr_srv_bridge_v25.h      | 39 +++++++++++++++++-
 4 files changed, 90 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/imagination/common/device_info/bxm-8-256.h b/src/imagination/common/device_info/bxm-8-256.h
index ea10721dc048..3da2dfa0f24e 100644
